<title>USA: Midland Resources buys Summit Petroleum.</title>
<headline>Midland Resources buys Summit Petroleum.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Midland Resources Inc said on Friday it completed its previously announced acquisition of Summit Petroleum.</p>
<p>Midland Resources signed a definitive agreement on July 17 to buy Summit Petroleum for $0.70 per share in cash.</p>
<p>Midland Acquisition Corp received over 81 percent of the tenders from Summit shareholders, Midland said.</p>
</text>
